# PREDICATES

The fixture's controlled vocabulary. The real one is grouped by subject
so two names for one fact sit next to each other; this one is small
enough that a single group carries it.

## Fixture facts

| predicate | packs | settled by | true when |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `does_a_fixture_thing` | testmod | task | the fixture pack's trigger, which exists so S021 has something to resolve |

## Retired

| retired | replaced by | when | why |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `did_a_fixture_thing` | `does_a_fixture_thing` | 2026-08-15 | a retired row so the fixture exercises the retired arm as well as the live one |
